----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party notices
----------------------------------------------------------------------------

lib/ljsocket.lua is ljsocket, a LuaJIT FFI socket library originally written
by CapsAdmin, in the form bundled with AutoSubs (github.com/tmoroney/auto-subs),
which is distributed under the MIT License, Copyright (c) 2023 Tom Moroney.
The MIT terms above apply to that file under that copyright. One change was
made here: every ffi.cdef call is wrapped in pcall so a second start inside the
same Lua state does not fail on a type redeclaration.

This bridge speaks the wire protocol of davinci-resolve-mcp
(github.com/samuelgursky/davinci-resolve-mcp, MIT License, Copyright (c)
2025-2026 DaVinci Resolve MCP Contributors and Bradford Operations LLC). No
code from that project is bundled here; the test suite checks out the project
at the protocol version this bridge tracks.
